UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventglib26ritchieroyal26207-20261024@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261024T135628Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261024
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261025
SUMMARY:Glib & Ritchie Royal
DESCRIPTION:Frederick legends\, Glib and Ritchie Royal\, are splitting the bill for an evening of unique and entrancing original music. Experience Ritchie Royal’s signature psych rock\, paired with Glib’s iconic jazz/rock hybrid that breaks genre barriers. This is gonna be a great one. See you there!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/glib-%26-ritchie-royal/26207/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventgrandfondue3abikedoctorfrederick23902-20261024@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261024T135628Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261024
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261025
SUMMARY:Grand Fondue: Bike Doctor Frederick
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Orchid Cellar Meadery & Winery on Saturday\, October 24th for a casual and fun\, yet challenging ride on a variety of terrain (road\, gravel\, dirt). The routes begin in Middletown\, MD and tour through various parts of Frederick County. Be prepared to ride a mixture of terrain both on and off-road (pavement\, gravel\, trail)! Event entry includes: Custom routes (along with GPS files and cue sheets)\, stocked aid stations (Half & Grand routes only)\, event glasses with ONE free drink per participant served at Orchid Cellar following the ride (for participants 21 and over only)\, ride snacks\, live music\, and various prizes/giveaways! Registration opens May 1st (entry fees increase on 7/1\, 8/1\, 9/1\, 10/1): Grand Fondue - $50\, $55\, $60\, $65\, $70 Half Fondue - $40\, $45\, $50\, $55\, $60 Mini Fondue - $30\, $35\, $40\, $45\, $50​ NO refunds\, transfers\, or deferments. All no-show registration will be donated to Heartly House. Start Times: 7:00-8:30am (Grand)\; 9:00-10:00am (Half)\; 10:00-11:00am (Mini) *Ride times are “rolling” which means you can start anytime during your designated time slot. This is to spread out arrival for parking and check-in\, as well as keep ride groups smaller on the roads. The venue will open at 6:30am (Grand Fondue riders may start as early as 7:00am). Please do NOT arrive earlier than 6:30am.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/grand-fondue%3a-bike-doctor-frederick/23902/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventjumbospumpkinpatchfallfestival11483-20261024@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261024T135628Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261024
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261025
SUMMARY:Jumbo's Pumpkin Patch Fall Festival
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season with a full day of festive fun for all ages at Jumbo’s Pumpkin Patch! From classic farm adventures to fall-themed attractions\, our Fall Fun Festival is the perfect weekend outing for families\, friends\, and pumpkin lovers. What’s Included with Admission: Your ticket includes unlimited access to a variety of seasonal attractions: Hayrides through the farm 30+ acre u-pick pumpkin patch (pumpkins sold by the pound) Corn maze (14 acres) Petting zoo Jumping pillow Giant slides Mini mazes for younger guests Playgrounds and yard games General Store with fall shopping and décor​ Optional Add-Ons: (Available for Purchase Onsite - Saturday and Sunday Only) Enhance your day with these fun extras: Pony Rides – $7 Face Painting – $4 Sandy Candy (Edible Sand Art) – $4 Corn Cannon – $5 (3 shots) ​ Food & Drinks: Come hungry! A variety of food\, snacks\, and beverages are available for purchase\, including selections from Liquidity Ale Works of Mt. Airy. Tickets available online or at the gate.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/jumbos-pumpkin-patch-fall-festival/11483/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
